A single platform to follow the Nerazzurri colours.
Exclusive news, photos, videos, Serie A, Champions League and the League Cup match commentaries: the new FCInterNews app, the leading newsfeed of the Nerazzurri, is the reference point to remain updated, live and in a complete customised way, on all the latest news from the Inter’s world.
The app now includes a notification system called 'Team +' which can be configured to give you advices when you are close to points of interest. These notifications contain small text reminders that warn you, for example, when you pass by an Inter store, a club, a gathering, etc.


▶ FEATURES OF THE APP

Downloading the app, you can:

- remain updated on the latest Nerazzurri’s news;
- check all the stats and the Inter’s standing in the different competitions;
- view fixtures and results;
- browse the photo and video gallery;
- listen to the podcasts from the Radio Nerazzurra;
- customise your Nerazzurri’s experience, thanks to the dedicated section “INTERests”.

▶ FOLLOW FCINTERNEWS

You can follow FCInterNews on the main Social Networks.
Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/www.fcinternews.it/
Twitter: https://twitter.com/FcInterNewsit
Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/fcinternewsofficial/
YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5v2T1pq-4lPxtQLMk4rv2g/

▶ With the new "No Ads" feature, the paid services offered are:
 - 1 Month for € 1.49, to subscribe to a subscription and block advertising for a period of 1 month;
 - 12 Months for € 5.99, to subscribe to a subscription and block advertising for a period of 1 year;
 - 6 Months for € 3.99, to sign up for a subscription and block advertising for a period of 6 months.

The payment will be charged to the iTunes account upon confirmation of the purchase. The renewal amount will be charged to your Account 24 hours before the end of the current period. Subscriptions can be managed by the user and auto-renewal can be disabled by visiting the Account Settings after purchase. The subscription will automatically renew at least 24 hours before the end of the current subscription.

By purchasing you accept our Terms and Conditions (https://www.fcinternews.it/?action=page&id=30), Privacy Policy (https://www.fcinternews.it/privacy-policy) and Payment Conditions (https://www.fcinternews.it/?action=page&id=29)

L'App ufficiale di Radio Bianconera, la radio dedicata ai tifosi della Vecchia Signora. Puoi ascoltare la diretta oppure i podcast dei tuoi programmi preferiti.

Con il palinsesto ascolterai:
- ogni giorno speciali, interviste ed esclusive sul mondo bianco nero;
- nei weekend dirette dai campi, gli aggiornamenti degli ultimi minuti, gli aneddoti e gli avversari;
- ancora: news, attualità, ospiti, commenti e riflessioni sul mondo bianconero e su tutto quello che vi gira intorno.

Inoltre troverai:
- tutti i podcast delle tue trasmissioni preferite da ascoltare dove e quando vuoi;
- condivisione di tutti i podcast delle tue trasmissioni preferite con il tuo mondo social;
- la WEB TV in diretta in streaming;
- la possibilità di rimanere sempre informato sull'inizio delle trasmissioni con le notifiche push.

Prova ora gratis Radio BiancoNera, l'unica che conta!
